Backup of ping's configs from ~/.config, plus shell dotfiles and
~/.local/bin/eww + hyprsunset.

Left out on purpose (huge app data, not the rice):
  discord, mozilla/firefox, Cursor, Code, Code - OSS, heroic,
  StardewValley, pulse, libvirt, lock/socket files.

Restore example:
  cp -a ~/apple/config/. ~/.config/
  cp -a ~/apple/local-bin/. ~/.local/bin/
  cp -a ~/apple/home/. ~/
